{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27317","headline":"鸟散余花落 · 孔温业","name":"鸟散余花落","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美景春堪赏，芳园白日斜。\n共看飞好鸟，复见落余花。\n来往惊翻电，经过想散霞。\n雨余飘处处，风送满家家。\n求友声初去，离枝色可嗟。\n从兹时节换，谁爲惜年华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔温业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}